<title>USA: ICE Holdings names unit chairman.</title>
<headline>ICE Holdings names unit chairman.</headline>
<dateline>PLAYA DEL REY, Calif. 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>ICE Holdings Inc said Wednsday that it has named Stuart McFarland chairman of its new subsidiary, Default Management Network Inc.</p>
<p>Most recently, he was general manager of GE Capital's mortgage business.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
